==================== Input ====================
/* A comment between the name and the colon never crosses the `:`
   (kept verbatim, glued, as Prettier prints it). */
$x /* between */: red;
$y /* between-empty */: ;
$z /* prettier-ignore */: red   blue;
$w/* glued */:red;

/* A comment after the colon stays before the `;`. */
$g: /* c */;

==================== Output ====================
